sequenceDiagram
    actor Master as Wellness Admin
    participant MasterUI as Wellness Admin Advanced
    participant EmployeeSDK as Employee WalletSdk
    participant EmployeeSecure as Employee Protected Storage
    participant MasterSDK as Wellness Admin WalletSdk
    participant MasterSecure as Wellness Admin Protected Storage
    participant Crypto as Configuration Crypto
    participant Horizon as Horizon Endpoint

    Master->>MasterUI: Enter NOWNodes endpoint and API key
    MasterUI->>MasterSDK: saveAppMasterProviderConfiguration(input)
    MasterSDK->>Horizon: Health check candidate configuration
    Horizon-->>MasterSDK: Healthy response
    MasterSDK->>MasterSecure: Commit protected configuration
    MasterSDK-->>MasterUI: Safe status and configuration version
    MasterUI-->>Master: Clear key field and show ready
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSecure: Create and store device configuration identity
    EmployeeSecure-->>EmployeeSDK: Device ID and public encryption key
    EmployeeSDK-->>MasterSDK: Activation request QR with device binding
    MasterSDK->>MasterSecure: Read provider configuration
    MasterSecure-->>MasterSDK: Endpoint, headers, and configuration version
    MasterSDK->>Crypto: Encrypt configuration for Employee device
    Crypto-->>MasterSDK: Device-bound ciphertext
    MasterSDK->>MasterSDK: Authorize response and bind request, device, expiry, version
    MasterSDK-->>EmployeeSDK: Activation response QR
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSDK: Verify authorization and device binding
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSecure: Read device configuration identity
    EmployeeSecure-->>EmployeeSDK: Protected decryption handle
    EmployeeSDK->>Crypto: Decrypt candidate configuration
    Crypto-->>EmployeeSDK: Candidate endpoint and provider headers
    EmployeeSDK->>Horizon: Health check with candidate configuration
    Horizon-->>EmployeeSDK: Healthy response
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSecure: Commit provider configuration
